{"4371900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Case File: Archived 3:12AM", "steam_appid": 4371900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚪 The Knock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>3:12 AM</strong>,<br>a knock echoes through the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So who is at the door?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/168e1bc9c45b416cba5fd58bc76b0a50.poster.avif?t=1775009306\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/168e1bc9c45b416cba5fd58bc76b0a50.webm?t=1775009306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/168e1bc9c45b416cba5fd58bc76b0a50.mp4?t=1775009306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕯️ The House Remembers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Ananya</strong>, a pregnant woman spending a restless night in a Kolkata home tied to a forgotten investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, nothing feels wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then a message appears that wasn’t there before.<br>A door opens that you remember locking.<br>A case file resurfaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And slowly… reality begins to slip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/21b1ba3586b4157c28f6450c4d8ec1d8.poster.avif?t=1775009306\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/21b1ba3586b4157c28f6450c4d8ec1d8.webm?t=1775009306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/21b1ba3586b4157c28f6450c4d8ec1d8.mp4?t=1775009306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 A House That Changes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooms stay the same — until they aren’t.<br>Objects move.<br>Moments repeat.<br>Small details change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you investigate, the less you trust what you see.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/d93ab38e68d39f971eca188ba48da06d.poster.avif?t=1775009306\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/d93ab38e68d39f971eca188ba48da06d.webm?t=1775009306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/d93ab38e68d39f971eca188ba48da06d.mp4?t=1775009306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧩 Investigate the Archived Case</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a realistic Kolkata apartment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine documents, phone messages, and CCTV recordings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice subtle environmental changes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together what really happened at <strong>3:12 AM</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/c1b4a24e42681b452cd67b55ce79c076.poster.avif?t=1775009306\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/c1b4a24e42681b452cd67b55ce79c076.webm?t=1775009306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/c1b4a24e42681b452cd67b55ce79c076.mp4?t=1775009306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Psychological Horror — No Combat, No Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No weapons.<br>No combat.<br>No predictable scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only silence.<br>Only repetition.<br>Only a house that remembers. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/50cdc2aef0cdebe7166f75281c0143f6.avif?t=1775009306\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras_big/50cdc2aef0cdebe7166f75281c0143f6.webp?t=1775009306 width=1560 height=1255 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👉 Wishlist <strong>Case File: Archived — 3:12 AM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cases were never meant to be reopened.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >📸 PRESS KIT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press kit (screenshots, logos, trailer, info):<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact: <a href=\"mailto:zippycreativestudios@gmail.com\">zippycreativestudios@gmail.com</a></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚪 The Knock</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>3:12 AM</strong>,<br>a knock echoes through the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So who is at the door?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/168e1bc9c45b416cba5fd58bc76b0a50.poster.avif?t=1775009306\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4371900/extras/168e1bc9c45b416cba5fd58bc76b0a50.webm?t=1775009306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat